---
import BaseLayout from "../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import HorizontalCard from "../../components/HorizontalCard.astro";
---

<BaseLayout title="Your Name | Personal Homepage" sideBarActiveItemID="home">
  <div class="pb-12 mt-5">
    <!-- 个人头像（请确保 public/ 目录下有对应的图片文件） -->
      <div class="shrink-0">
        <img
          src="/ld.jpg"
          alt="Profile"
          class="w-36 h-36 md:w-44 md:h-44 rounded-full object-cover shadow-md border border-base-200"
        />
    </div>
    <div class="text-xl py-1">Hello 👋</div>
    <div class="text-5xl font-bold">Dong Li</div>
    <div class="text-3xl py-3 font-bold">College of Cyber Security, Jinan University / Qinglan Scholar</div>
    <div class="py-2">
      <text class="text-lg">
        I am currently a Faculty Member and a Qinglan Scholar at the College of Cyber Security, Jinan University. I received my Ph.D. in Engineering from Chongqing University in 2026 under the supervision of Prof. Xiaofeng Liao (Fellow of IEEE/AAIA/AIIA, Changjiang Distinguished Professor, and Director of the Key Laboratory of Dependable Service Computing in Cyber Physical Society, Ministry of Education). Previously, I was a Visiting Scholar at Nanyang Technological University (NTU), Singapore, working with Prof. Anupam Chattopadhyay (Fellow of TWAS and IEEE Senior Member).<br/>
        My research interests focus on cutting-edge areas including searchable encryption, privacy-preserving computation, and distributed machine learning security. I have published over 15 high-quality papers in prestigious international journals and conferences, including more than 10 papers in IEEE Transactions (such as IEEE TIFS, IEEE TDSC, IEEE TSC, IEEE TCE, IEEE TCC, IEEE TCNS, and IEEE TNSE), with over 10 of them as the first or corresponding author. Additionally, I have applied for more than 6 national invention patents. I have served as a Guest Editor for the international journal CMC-Computers, Materials & Continua, and actively serve as a regular reviewer for renowned journals including IEEE TIFS, IEEE TPDS, IEEE TDSC, IEEE TCC, IEEE TCE, IEEE TNSE, and NCAA.<br/>
        Furthermore, I served as the Principal Investigator (PI) for the Chongqing Graduate Scientific Research Innovation Project, and participated as a key contributor in several major research projects, including the National Key R&D Program of China, the Key Program and General Program of the National Natural Science Foundation of China (NSFC), as well as million-RMB-level industry-sponsored projects.
      </text>
    </div>
    <div class="mt-8">
      <a class="btn btn-sm md:btn-md" href="mailto:lilvmy@163.com" target="_blank">Contact Me</a>
        <a class="btn btn-sm md:btn-md btn-outline" href="https://github.com/lilvmy" target="_blank">GitHub</a>
        <a class="btn btn-sm md:btn-md btn-outline" href="https://scholar.google.com/citations?user=AndU888AAAAJ&hl=zh-CN" target="_blank">Google Scholar</a>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div>
    <div class="text-3xl w-full font-bold mb-2">Featured Projects</div>
  </div>

  <HorizontalCard
    title="Featured Project 1"
    img="/post_img.webp"
    desc="A brief summary of the problem solved, core technologies used, and key outcomes."
    url="/en/projects"
    badge="NEW"
  />
  <div class="divider my-0"></div>
  <HorizontalCard
    title="Featured Project 2"
    img="/post_img.webp"
    desc="A brief description of your second highlighted project or research work."
    url="/en/projects"
  />
</BaseLayout>
